   "he": "רָבָא אָמַר: אֲפִילּוּ דְּבֵין יִבּוּם לַחֲלוּקָּה נָמֵי לָא שָׁקֵיל, מַאי טַעְמָא? כִּבְכוֹר, מָה בְּכוֹר אֵין לוֹ קוֹדֶם חֲלוּקָּה, אַף יָבָם נָמֵי אֵין לוֹ קוֹדֶם חֲלוּקָּה.",
   "en": "«Rava says: Even with regard to» the enhancement that occurs «between the levirate marriage and the distribution» of the inheritance, the yavam «does not take» it. «What is the reason?» He is compared «to a firstborn: Just as a firstborn does not have» any special right to the inheritance «before» its «distribution, so too, a yavam does not have» any right to the inheritance «before» its «distribution.»"
  }
